Accelerator Integration > Target Audience
This document is intended for:

* **Accelerator Developers** who are integrating accelerator into PyTorch;

* **Advanced PyTorch Users** interested in the inner workings of key modules;

Test Suite Reuse > Bring-up Workflow > 5. Handle precision differences
Use `op_overrides` for backend-specific numerical or precision differences:

```python
PrivateUse1TestBase.set_test_configs(
    op_allowlist=("add.Tensor", "div.Tensor"),
